## Python ↔ Rust 1:1 모듈 매핑

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 아래 표는 **목표(TO-BE) 매핑**입니다.
> 현재 저장소 구현은 일부만 반영되어 있으며, 누락/불일치가 존재합니다.

```
Python (기존)                            Rust (신규, rust_core/src/)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
constants.py                          → constants.rs
  DATA_CHANNEL_TYPE, WebRTCConnectionMethod,    (동일 Enum/Dict, PyO3로 Python 노출)
  RTC_TOPIC, SPORT_CMD, VUI_COLOR, AUDIO_API

encryption.py                         → encryption.rs
  aes_encrypt/decrypt, rsa_encrypt,             (aes + rsa crate)
  generate_aes_key, rsa_load_public_key

multicast_scanner.py                  → multicast.rs
  discover_ip_sn (UDP multicast)                (std::net::UdpSocket)

unitree_auth.py                       → signaling.rs
  send_sdp_to_local_peer (old/new method)       (reqwest blocking)
  decrypt_con_notify_data                       (aes-gcm crate)

util.py                               → util.rs
  generate_uuid, get_nested_field,              (uuid crate, serde_json)
  fetch_token, fetch_public_key,
  fetch_turn_server_info, print_status

webrtc_driver.py                      → connection.rs
  UnitreeWebRTCConnection                       (datachannel-rs PeerConnection)
  connect/disconnect/reconnect/_auto_reconnect

webrtc_datachannel.py                 → datachannel.rs
  WebRTCDataChannel                             (메시지 디스패치, 바이너리 파싱)
  deal_array_buffer, deal_array_buffer_for_*

webrtc_video.py                       → video.rs
  WebRTCVideoChannel                            (media feature 트랙 수신)
  track_callbacks, switchVideoChannel

webrtc_audio.py                       → audio.rs
  WebRTCAudioChannel                            (media feature 트랙 수신)
  frame_handler, switchAudioChannel

webrtc_audiohub.py                    → audiohub.rs
  WebRTCAudioHub                                (오디오 파일 관리/업로드)
  get_audio_list, play_by_uuid, upload, etc.

lidar/lidar_decoder_native.py         → lidar_native.rs
  decompress (lz4), bits_to_points              (lz4_flex, Zero-Copy PyArray)

lidar/lidar_decoder_libvoxel.py       → lidar_wasm.rs
  WASM decoder via wasmtime                     (wasmtime Rust 네이티브)

lidar/lidar_decoder_unified.py        → lidar.rs
  UnifiedLidarDecoder                           (native/wasm 선택 인터페이스)

msgs/pub_sub.py                       → msgs/pubsub.rs
  WebRTCDataChannelPubSub                       (subscribe, publish, throttle)

msgs/future_resolver.py               → msgs/future_resolver.rs
  FutureResolver                                (요청-응답 매칭, 청크 병합)

msgs/heartbeat.py                     → msgs/heartbeat.rs
  WebRTCDataChannelHeartBeat                    (2초 간격, 6초 타임아웃)

msgs/validation.py                    → msgs/validation.rs
  WebRTCDataChannelValidaton                    (MD5+Base64 인증)

msgs/rtc_inner_req.py                 → msgs/rtc_inner_req.rs
  WebRTCDataChannelRTCInnerReq                  (네트워크 상태, 파일 업/다운)
  WebRTCDataChannelNetworkStatus
  WebRTCDataChannelFileUploader
  WebRTCDataChannelFileDownloader

msgs/error_handler.py                 → msgs/error_handler.rs
  handle_error, get_error_code_text             (에러 메시지 매핑)

__init__.py                           → lib.rs (PyO3 엔트리)
  monkey-patches 제거 (Rust에선 불필요)          + Python 자동 전환 로직
```

